### compose containers resolve each other by service name (own network lab2net)
$ docker compose ... exec web python -c "import socket; print(\"redis IP:\", socket.gethostbyname(\"redis\"))"
redis IP: 172.19.0.2

$ curl http://localhost:5000/health   (web served by compose)
{"status":"UP","version":"2.0.0"}


